---
flowchart LR
  A[业务库 binlog]:::source --> B[Flink 实时计算]:::compute
  L[埋点日志]:::source --> B
  B --> C[(数仓 ODS/DWD)]:::store
  C --> D[(ADS 指标)]:::store
  D --> E[BI 报表]:::consume
classDef source fill:#FBDBD1,stroke:#B09992,color:#712A14
classDef compute fill:#D2D6F1,stroke:#9396A9,color:#1F2865
classDef store fill:#D8F0ED,stroke:#97A8A6,color:#256058
classDef consume fill:#F6DEB6,stroke:#AC9B7F,color:#714E14
classDef layer fill:#EBF1F9,stroke:#3B6FC2,color:#33384A,stroke-dasharray:5 4
%% 用法：节点 A:::source 或 class A,B source
